OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FWidely cloudy across the region
OL,6,Fto start with the odd spot of rain and
OL,7,Fsome hill fog across the uplands.
OL,8,FTurning mostly dry with the odd
OL,9,Fbrighter spell through the day. Light
OL,10,Fwinds and near average temperatures.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FGenerally cloudy through the
OL,13,Fevening and overnight. Dry for most
OL,14,Fareas initially but with patchy rain
OL,15,Fand mist developing as the night
OL,16,Fprogresses. Light winds. Cool,
OL,17,Fespecially in rural areas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
